  m_Name: TradeRailStation
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BuildingDefinition
  id: TradeRailStation
  displayName: Railway Station
  description: 'A brick station with a clock tower and an iron canopy over the platform.
    Runs steam trains on 3 routes, where rail track is laid along most of the way
    (wagon trains otherwise). Build one in each of two towns (a town has housing
    or a town centre) and a trade route opens between them; caravans then go to and
    fro, and every trip brings coin and goods: more for long routes between big towns,
    and more on roads. Outposts the route passes produce more. Raiders attack caravans
    on the road.'
